<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-13T00:53:25.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:53:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard, Navy and Marine Corps have recently repelled five unauthorized Vietnam-flagged fishing vessels near Kota Island and confronted the Chinese research vessel Tan Suo Yi Hao when it entered the area, while continuing to block Chinese Coast Guard water-cannon attacks on its ships conducting medical evacuations at Ayungin Shoal and in the Luzon Strait. An upgraded PCG station was opened on Pag-asa Island, strengthening the Philippines' presence on the disputed atoll. The Philippine Navy also conducted passing exercises with Japanese vessels. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPMDVPaC1NeklPQlVLWGJleVZXdE16RGpNaktwN1pmcVhEVnRGZ1hHcFU4dk00Nk9scEJTemlaQnRUUV9yOEdCUGFma3Q4NDRGaVUxZ01UdnZQR1lGUmk0aXZqOWZDenpieDI3d0RZYktFbkt4dlJLSXhMNnR6VmJDU2Fkenk1bzRUUUx1RlhHNHBSZUp2ekIxRXFIbjFzUFNMRkNuQUI0Mkw1Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;SSBCrack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPdGlzdUlGVjJ2a0tVMlI3NGhvQ1YxQlladDVzRjY5bUJLeXBlUHBFNnhFbWFVX1RpQTdHejFtQXNEYmdONHA0VFZBYWpVXzViNERqM1VQWEJCRVhFek1TUGJoR3Y1SzJmeDJORFRwbDItSlFsaVFOUzJlbDdzZ1R0VWs5VURBcjZQNjlRbTV1VnBFeVBQWlBMX001RGY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Strategist | ASPI's analysis and commentary site&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Wired Gov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQdm1STTVzR1hFaFZpZHh